    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to No. 14 Belline Close, Banagher Court, Piltown, Co. Kilkenny, a well-maintained end-of-terrace three-bedroom residence enjoying a large private garden to the rear.\r\n\r\nThe property offers well-presented accommodation arranged over two floors, with a practical layout suited to modern family living. On entering, the accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, sitting room, kitchen, utility area and WC. The sitting room features a fireplace, while the kitchen is fully fitted and provides access to the rear. The adjoining utility area includes fitted units and is plumbed for a washing machine.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three bedrooms together with the main bathroom. The bedrooms are well proportioned, with a combination of tiled and carpeted flooring throughout.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property benefits from a large private garden, providing an attractive addition to the accommodation and valuable outdoor space. The end-of-terrace position further complements the property.\r\n\r\nLocated close to Piltown village centre, No. 14 Belline Close will appeal to those seeking a well-maintained home in a convenient residential setting, with the benefit of generous private outdoor space.\r\n\r\nViewing is strictly by appointment and is highly recommended to appreciate the accommodation and setting this property has to offer.\r\n\r\nFEATURES & AMENITIES\r\nEnd-of-terrace position within Banagher Court\r\nLarge private garden to the rear\r\nWell-maintained throughout\r\nSitting room with feature fireplace\r\nFully fitted kitchen\r\nSeparate utility area with fitted units\r\nPlumbing provided for washing machine\r\nGround-floor WC\r\nBuilt-in wardrobe to Bedroom 1\r\nConvenient location close to Piltown village centre"
      },
